# Map commit identities to the preferred display name for this project.
# GitHub's Contributors graph uses account-linked emails, but tools that respect
# .mailmap (git shortlog, git log --use-mailmap) will show the Sanctify identity.
sanctify-agent <agent@sanctify.in>
sanctify-agent <agent@sanctify.in> Kiro Agent <244629292+kiro-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
